WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.940
What is a plugin?

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:06.770
A plugin is a saved set of instructions that turns a chatbot into a helper for one job.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:11.150
How to use it, watch the demo video at the top of the page.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:13.630
Tap go there to open it.
